#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""antagonist — run an independent adversarial review through a selectable
LLM backend and keep a durable record of the run.

Backends (selected with --backend):
  codex      OpenAI Codex CLI, `codex exec`, read-only sandbox, can read the repo
  agy        Google Antigravity CLI, `agy -p`, read-only reviewer agent; searches the
             repo and, where its sandbox works, runs checks in it
  claude     Claude Code CLI, `claude -p`, safe mode, plan mode, read-only tools
  anthropic  Anthropic Messages API (raw HTTP), evidence must be pasted
  moonshot   Moonshot/Kimi chat completions API (OpenAI-compatible), pasted
  local      any OpenAI-compatible endpoint (ollama, llama.cpp, ...), pasted

INVARIANT: no known credential value (configured key files, secret-looking
environment variables of 8+ chars) reaches the terminal or any file this
program writes itself; API stream lines are redacted before logging;
authenticated HTTP never follows a redirect. CLI children run with those
variables removed from their environment and their logs are redacted after
they exit, so a worker killed mid-run can leave raw CLI output behind.
INVARIANT: a run is `done` only when the backend showed completion evidence
(exit 0, a well-formed stream with its final marker) and produced visible
text of its own, before any truncation marker is appended.
INVARIANT: every run leaves a self-describing directory under the runs root
(prompt as sent, the exact stdin file, literal command, raw output, result,
metadata), mode 0700.
INVARIANT: agy never runs as its default agent, which can write files in its
workspace without asking; every agy run uses a generated agent that has no
write tool, in a workspace directory inside the run directory.
CAVEAT: CLI backends may read the repo with their own tools; API backends
see only what --evidence pastes in. Paste evidence in both cases: path-only
prompts produce confident reports from model memory.
CAVEAT: the preflight check (harness versions, model catalogs) only warns;
it never switches a model or upgrades a CLI. Comparable runs need a stable
model, so currency is a decision, not a default.
"""

